  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "releaseNotes": "6.1.0 — Additive: adds AppRoleNames (namespace Brainograph.Utilities.Models.EntityBase), the compile-time const mirror of the frozen AppAdminRole/AppUserRole names — one const per role plus AllAdmins (11-name CSV in enum order) and All (12 names: admins + User), for use in [Authorize(Roles = ...)], which accepts constants only. Also query-ready arrays: AllAdminNames / AllAdminNormalizedNames (11, ADMIN-ONLY — the admin gate) and AllNames / AllNormalizedNames (12, includes User — NOT an admin gate); plus UserNormalized (\"USER\") for EF NormalizedName predicates and Service, the S2S pseudo-role held deliberately outside the frozen enums. Pinned against the enums by AppRoleNamesTests. No existing type changed; drop-in over 6.0.0. PREVIOUSLY, 6.0.0 — Unified Users: audit actor columns (CreatedBy/ModifiedBy/DeletedBy) retyped bigint→Guid on IAuditableEntity and AuditableEntity<T>; adds PlatformIdentity (pinned uuid_v5 user-map namespace + Guid.Empty service principal). Epoch *At columns, entity PKs, enums, filters and the JWT surface unchanged.",
